# Fast gate: only what the change itself can break.
#   - lint-staged runs ESLint + Prettier on the staged files only
#   - types is the full TS check (native TS 7, well under a second)
#   - the Vitest suite runs in ~4s, so there is nothing to gain by selecting
#
# Playwright deliberately does NOT run here. It runs on push (@smoke) and on
# demand (npm run test:e2e:full). See AGENTS.md -> Testing.
npx lint-staged && npm run types && npm run test
